# iPhone originals — converted to .jpg for the web and never committed.
# They are 2-3MB each and no browser renders them. A `git add -A` swept 46 of
# them into the index on 2026-08-16; this is the guard against a repeat.
# Method: Memory/reference/heic_to_web_conversion.md
*.HEIC
*.heic

# IndexNow: the KEY FILE (<key>.txt) is public by design and IS committed.
