Reports/

# Windows Explorer copy-duplicates. Assets/Gallery/ IS published, so an
# unguarded `git add -A` ships these to her live site - the same class as the
# Assets/Gallery/_duplicates/ leak caught on 2026-09-10. Referenced by nothing.
* - Copy.*
* - Copy (*).*

